  📗
    Serves *app* where its settings say, server.host and server.port, until a
    stop is requested by SIGTERM, SIGINT or 🛑 on the app. Returns 0 after a
    clean stop and 1 when it could not start.
    If requests are still in hand when the grace period ends, the process
    exits with 1 instead of returning. Workers with nothing in hand are
    always waited for: they finish within a quarter of a second.
